@host = http://localhost:5080

### Happy path — mixed basket: two Bs (2-for-45) + one A (50). Expect 200, total 95.
POST {{host}}/checkout/total
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": { "B": 2, "A": 1 } }

### Happy path — offer applies twice: six As (two 3-for-130 groups). Expect 200, total 260.
POST {{host}}/checkout/total
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": { "A": 6 } }

### Unknown SKU. Expect 400 application/problem+json with a per-SKU errors map.
POST {{host}}/checkout/total
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": { "Z": 1 } }

### Negative quantity. Expect 400 application/problem+json.
POST {{host}}/checkout/total
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": { "A": -1 } }

### Overflow — 42,949,673 × 50 exceeds int.MaxValue. Expect 500 problem+json, no leaked detail.
POST {{host}}/checkout/total
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": { "A": 42949673 } }
